.git
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.astro
**/.build-tmp
uploader/data
# Private qualification fixtures, credentials and browser profiles are not image inputs.
**/.local
**/.issue-runtime
map-assets
docs/*
!docs/third-party-inventory.json
!docs/third-party-evidence.json
!docs/third-party-image-evidence.json
*.md
# Bootstrap secrets (DATABASE_URL / POSTGRES_PASSWORD). `COPY uploader/ .` and
# `COPY site/ .` run from this root context, so uploader/.dockerignore is inert
# here — mirror .gitignore's .env rules at every depth. (#111)
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
# Never import a host-built native addon into a different architecture image.
uploader/native
.issue-runtime
**/public/legal
source-release.json
